{"agent_mode": null, "bash_calls": 2, "candidate_provenance": null, "cell_seed": 15280373101334503040, "checker_exit": 0, "checker_stderr": "", "checker_stdout": "parse_date accepts Z as UTC; naive inputs still parse\nOBENCH_VERDICT: pass\n", "checker_workspace_files": {".pytest_cache/.gitignore": {"bytes": 37, "mtime": 1792277292.0230064, "sha256": "3ed731b65d06150c138e2dadb0be0697550888a6b47eb8c45ecc9adba8b8e9bd"}, ".pytest_cache/CACHEDIR.TAG": {"bytes": 191, "mtime": 1792277292.0230064, "sha256": "37dc88ef9a0abeddbe81053a6dd8fdfb13afb613045ea1eb4a5c815a74a3bde4"}, ".pytest_cache/README.md": {"bytes": 302, "mtime": 1792277292.0230064, "sha256": "73fd6fccdd802c419a6b2d983d6c3173b7da97558ac4b589edec2dfe443db9ad"}, ".pytest_cache/v/cache/nodeids": {"bytes": 115, "mtime": 1792277292.0230064, "sha256": "0c028942684af7b8390dd98146e21d481c544a6c63ffe5db76c1057dd6763df1"}, "conftest.py": {"bytes": 170, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "06b695b20fd58f648912e2ff9e51ad183c9f2203f2786182ac0916ea4102d983"}, "dates/__init__.py": {"bytes": 0, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855"}, "dates/parse.py": {"bytes": 212, "mtime": 1792277283.8790066, "sha256": "b1d2a10cb5bffe799fa52776a3e04d1cf7f99917f62f5839ad48f903af8ee2ce"}, "tests/test_parse.py": {"bytes": 371, "mtime": 1792267701.6406474, "sha256": "491695a5fb3286eaa6bd1eb3ba834d44a5b64980e878703f60e07aa02d7fa041"}}, "child_edit_calls": 0, "child_plan_reminder": false, "cmd": ["/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp", "-p", "`tests/test_parse.py::test_dates` fails with `ValueError: unconverted data remains: Z`. Please fix `parse_date`.\n", "--mode", "json", "--provider", "vertex-anthropic", "--model", "claude-opus-5-5", "--yolo", "--session-dir", "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/transcripts/aa-1/trig-omp-reported/13/session"], "completed": true, "dotnet_build_calls": 0, "edit_calls": 1, "ended_on_rejection": false, "error": null, "exec_mode": "local", "failure_class": "solved", "failure_reason": null, "faults_served": 0, "final_answer_complete": true, "final_answer_present": true, "final_answer_source": "json", "final_workspace": "/workspace/openbench-ab/results/step5-opus-aa-1017-omp36-aa/omp-36/cells/aa-1/trig-omp-reported/13/workspace", "first_after_build": false, "first_side": "aa-2", "fresh_subagents": 0, "harness": "omp", "harness_version": "omp/17.3.8 (/workspace/openbench-ab/results/omp-cache/bin/omp/5347ff91e8f44f2c69a79d7b152b7301687cd5c8/omp)", "harness_version_source": "host", "host": "grok-bot-vm-412615941", "image_digest": null, "last_activity_age_s": null, "list_has_generated": null, "main_agent_searched": false, "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "model_context_window": 1000000, "model_max_tokens": 128000, "output_tail": "`datetime.fromisoformat` (3.11+, env is 3.13) accepts `Z` and offsets, and still returns naive datetimes for naive input \u2014 keeps `test_naive`/`day_key` behavior.\nFixed. `parse_date` in `dates/parse.py` now uses `datetime.fromisoformat(s)` instead of `strptime` with a fixed format. All 3 tests in `tests/test_parse.py` pass, including `test_dates`.\n\n- **Cause:** the old format `\"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%S\"` didn't allow a timezone suffix, so the trailing `Z` (UTC) was left unparsed and raised the error.\n- **What changes for callers:** input ending in `Z` or a `+HH:MM` offset now returns a datetime that carries its timezone. Input without a suffix still returns one without a timezone, as before, so `test_naive` and `day_key` behave the same.\n- **Things to watch:**\n  - This needs Python 3.11 or newer, because older versions of `fromisoformat` reject `Z`. This environment has 3.13.\n  - Code that compares or subtracts a timezone-aware result against a timezone-less datetime will raise `TypeError`. Inside this repo the only callers are `day_key` and the tests, and neither does that.\n  - `day_key` still uses the date as written in the string and doesn't convert it to UTC.", "paced_wait_s": 0.0, "params_stripped": [], "params_stripped_requests": 0, "permission_rejections": 0, "read_calls": 2, "replies_ok": 5, "replies_throttled": 0, "requests_cache_read": 51949, "requests_cache_write": 78879, "requests_cost_usd": 0.42951280000000003, "requests_count": 5, "requests_input_uncached": 12, "requests_output": 1234, "reread": false, "rule_order": "none", "rule_prefix": "neither", "run_id": "omp:trig-omp-reported:claude-opus-5-5:trial13", "run_seed": 1016, "sampling_observed": null, "schedule_index": 25, "score": 1.0, "started_at": "2026-10-17T22:47:51.659877+00:00", "subagent_resumed": false, "subagent_write_calls": 0, "success": true, "t_agent_s": 25.909, "t_checker_s": 0.326, "t_env_setup_s": 0.001, "task": "trig-omp-reported", "task_calls": 0, "thinking_mode": "default", "thinking_sent": ["adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive", "adaptive"], "timeout_s": 840, "tmpdir_leaked_dirs": 0, "token_basis": "proxy_measured", "token_basis_main": "estimated", "token_basis_proxy": "proxy_measured", "tokens": 1246, "tokens_cache_read": 51949, "tokens_cache_write": 78879, "tokens_fresh": 1246, "tokens_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_cache_read": 51949, "tokens_main_cache_write": 78879, "tokens_main_calls": 5, "tokens_main_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_main_output": 1234, "tokens_output": 1234, "tokens_proxy_cache_read": 51949, "tokens_proxy_cache_write": 78879, "tokens_proxy_calls": 5, "tokens_proxy_input_uncached": 12, "tokens_proxy_output": 1234, "tokens_proxy_reasoning": null, "tokens_reasoning": 0, "trial": 13, "ts_iso": "2026-10-17T18:47:51", "turn_mode": null, "turns": 5, "upstream_model": "claude-opus-5-5", "usage_raw": [{"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 25195, "cost": {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 0, "input": 0, "output": 0, "total": 0}, "cttl": {"ephemeral5m": 25195}, "input": 4, "output": 87, "totalTokens": 25286}, {"cacheRead": 0, "cacheWrite": 25497, "cost": {"cacheRe